@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Return Report for Review

DEVELOPER OWNER: Haya
MODULE: Sourcing Manager Review
TRELLO TASK: Return Report for Review
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/r1oVUbDr

PURPOSE:
Return the report to the Sourcing Officer for correction.
The decision is stored on the report version it applies to.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Sourcing Manager

ROUTE: /SourcingManager/Reports/Return/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- POST Return: set ReviewedByUserId, ReviewComment,
  ReviewedAt and the report Status on this version only.
- Notify the Sourcing Officer; write AuditLogs.
- Never change committee scores or votes.

DEPENDENCIES:
TenderReports, Notifications, AuditLogs.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Return Report for Review";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Report Review";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Return the report to the Sourcing Officer for correction. Earlier versions and decisions stay in history.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Report</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Tender</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Version</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Submitted by</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Submitted</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Recommended offer</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<partial name="_ConfirmAction" model='new ConfirmActionModel("Return Report for Review", "Return the report to the Sourcing Officer for correction.", "Sets the report version to Returned with your comment. The Officer submits a new version; this one is kept.", true, false)' />

<nav class="pg-links" aria-label="Related pages">
    <ul>
        <li><a asp-area="SourcingManager" asp-controller="Reports" asp-action="Review">Back to review</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
